        "\\pgfdeclaredecoration{expanding waves}",
        "\\pgfpatharc",
        "\\pgfdecoratedcompleteddistance"
      ],
      "findings": "Fixed waves has one positive-width state per complete segment. Expanding waves consumes an initial empty state, then draws arcs whose radius and negative local x offset equal completed decoration distance. A zero remainder switches directly to final; the zero-width last state runs only for a positive partial remainder smaller than one segment."
    },
